# Raw Jira / Smartsheet exports. Public repo: these carry Atlassian account ids
# and, in the ECR cost-field templates, internal labor rates. Commit pruned
# derivatives (data/<team>/tracker-snapshot.csv, data/shared/*.json) instead.
# Both patterns: exports land in a team container now, but a stray one at the
# old top-level path must stay ignored too.
data/prak_jira_snapshot-*.csv
data/**/prak_jira_snapshot-*.csv
.vmodel/
